000F45r 2               ; ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
000F45r 2               ; NORMAL Polynomial SUBROUTINE
000F45r 2               ;
000F45r 2               ; P(X) = C(0)*X^N + C(1)*X^(N-1) + ... + C(N)
000F45r 2               ;
000F45r 2               ; WHERE:  X IS VALUE IN FAC
000F45r 2               ;	Y,A POINTS AT COEFFICIENT TABLE
000F45r 2               ;	FIRST BYTE OF COEFF. TABLE IS N
000F45r 2               ;	COEFFICIENTS FOLLOW, HIGHEST POWER FIRST
