001100r 2               ;
001100r 2               ;   Inline-ported from msbasic-master/{var,array,string,memory}.s and
001100r 2               ;   misc2.s (GivAyf/SngFlt).  All MSBASIC externals are resolved here:
001100r 2               ;
001100r 2               ;     SynErr / MemErr / IqErr / Gme / SubErr        - error trampolines
001100r 2               ;     ChkCom / ChkCls / ChkNum / ChkStr             - parser predicates
001100r 2               ;     MakInt / FrmNum / FrmEvl                      - minimal stubs (only
001100r 2               ;                                                     handle literal unsigned
001100r 2               ;                                                     decimals via Fin; full
001100r 2               ;                                                     evaluator wired in a
001100r 2               ;                                                     later phase)
001100r 2               ;     IsLetC                                        - ASCII letter test
001100r 2               ;     PtrGet / Array / GetAry                       - variable lookup
001100r 2               ;     StrIni / StrSpa / GetSpa / PutNew / MovStr    - string allocation
001100r 2               ;     Garbag (and helpers)                          - string GC
001100r 2               ;     Bltu / Reason                                 - block-up-move helpers
001100r 2               ;     AyInt / GivAyf / SngFlt                       - FP <-> 16-bit int
001100r 2               ;     BasCmdClr                                     - implements CLR / NEW core
001100r 2               ; =============================================================================
